  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1202.09 Sanitary survey",
  "priorExpiration": "2010-04-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1202.09 “Sanitary survey” means an on-site inspection of the water source, facilities, equipment, operation, and maintenance of a PORS for the purpose of evaluating the adequacy of such source, facilities, equipment, operation, and maintenance for producing and distributing safe drinking water to its consumers.\n\nSource. #9572, INTERIM, eff 10-21-09, EXPIRES: 4-19-10; ss by #9660, eff 2-24-10; ss by #12582, eff 7-24-18 (from Env-Dw 1202.10)",
